    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#242424;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:92%">Oncor uses Account 123.1 to record Goodwill reflecting the excess of the purchase price over the fair value of net assets acquired in merger and acquisition transactions. As of December 31, 2023, the balance of Account 123.1 reflects $4,064 million of purchase accounting effects arising from a 2007 merger transaction whereby a portion of the transaction goodwill was assigned to Oncor and $676 million of goodwill recorded due to Oncor&#8217;s 2019 InfraREIT acquisition. Oncor&#8217;s 2019 investment of $1,324 million in Oncor Electric Delivery Company NTU LLC reflects both the fair value of the identifiable tangible and intangible assets acquired and liabilities assumed based on their fair values as of May 16, 2019 and the excess of the purchase price over fair value resulting in recognition of $676 million of Goodwill. See Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements 1, and 11 for additional information.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-7" id="fn-7" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Balances in these regulatory assets are adjusted to reflect the difference in amounts that are approved in rates and the amounts that would have been recorded as charges or credits to earnings under application of ASC 715-30 and 715-60. Amounts as of December 31, 2021 are being amortized over a 5-year period per Docket No. 53601.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-8" id="fn-8" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:98%">Adjustments to the balance in the Minimum Pension Liability are based on an annual pension liability study performed by the Company's actuary and adjustments are charged to FERC Account No. 182, Employee Pensions and Benefits.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-9" id="fn-9" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
