    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-21" id="fn-21" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">Oncor Electric Delivery Company LLC uses FERC Account 447.0000 to record the revenues for Network Transmission Service (NTS).</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-22" id="fn-22" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Not applicable to Network Transmission Service (NTS) tariff.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-23" id="fn-23" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Oncor Electric Delivery Company LLC (Oncor) uses FERC Account 447 to record the revenue for high voltage Network Transmission Services (NTS). Oncor has no "wheeling" contracts.</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-24" id="fn-24" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%">Amounts shown in column (g) ''Other Charges'' represent transmission access fees.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-25" id="fn-25" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For regulatory reporting purposes, the balance in the Asset Retirement Obligation (ARO) regulatory liability, labeled as "Estimated net removal costs", has been reclassified in order to reflect this balance as accumulated depreciation, consistent with how these costs have been treated in the Company's rate making proceedings.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-26" id="fn-26" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%">Costs include direct, incidental and support charges incurred for work performed in support of operating as a rate-regulated enterprise including costs of rate and tariff proceedings, rule-makings, miscellaneous regulatory filings, and reporting.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-27" id="fn-27" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%">With the approval of Oncor's base-rate review (Docket 53601, approved April 2, 2023), the following dockets' regulatory asset balances were re-classed to and are currently being recovered and amortized under Docket 53601 rate case expense rider:</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%">Docket 48231, Docket 48325, Docket 49721, Docket 49427, and Docket 51996</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-28" id="fn-28" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">For the three months ended Mar 31, 2026, Oncor Electric Delivery Company LLC's Total Monthly Energy Values represent deliveries of billed electricity megawatt hours for retail electric providers (REPs) for the benefit of ultimate consumers.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-29" id="fn-29" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%">For ERCOT utilities, pro-forma tariff statistical classification data for columns (e) through (j) is not applicable. In ERCOT, wholesale transmission charges are billed to all Distribution Service Providers in the region on the basis of each Distribution Service Provider's load contribution to the prior year's ERCOT 4CP (the average of the load coincident with the ERCOT peaks in June, July, August, and September of the prior year).</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-30" id="fn-30" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%">For the year ended December 31, 2025, Oncor Electric Delivery Company LLC's megawatt hours represent megawatts for delivery services provided to retail electric providers (REPs) and not ultimate consumers.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:92%">These customers are billed on a demand basis. Megawatt hours are not shown on bills rendered to customers.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-31" id="fn-31" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">For ERCOT utilities, pro-forma tariff statistical classification data for columns (e) through (j) is not applicable.&#160; In ERCOT, wholesale transmission charges are billed to all Distribution Service Providers in the region on the basis of each Distribution Service Provider's load contribution to the prior year's ERCOT 4CP (the average of the load coincident with the ERCOT peaks in June, July, August, and September of the prior year).&#160; The peaks reported in previous Oncor FERC Form No.1/3Q filings may be adjusted based on currently available data. ERCOT resettles and trues up interval data in subsequent months, sometimes after the quarterly FERC Form No.1/3Q has been filed. Those adjustments are reflected herein.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-32" id="fn-32" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">For regulatory reporting purposes, the balance in the Asset Retirement Obligation (ARO) regulatory liability, labeled as "Estimated net removal costs", has been reclassified to accumulated depreciation, consistent with how these costs are treated in the Company's rate making proceedings.</link:footnote>
